4. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL IN THIS REPOSITORY
------------------------------------------

tests/vendor/  fbc's own test suite, vendored unmodified at the commit named in
               tests/vendor/CORPUS-COMMIT. It carries FreeBASIC's terms;
               fbcunit/ is LGPL-2.1-or-later (fbcunit/license.txt).
wiki/          the FreeBASIC manual, reproduced under the GNU FDL 1.3 with no
               Invariant Sections. See wiki/License.md.


5. WHAT A TOOLCHAIN PACKAGE CARRIES
-----------------------------------

build/package.sh assembles toolchains/tiko-*/, which also redistributes
FreeBASIC's headers in inc/, fbcunit (LGPL-2.1-or-later), SQLite (public domain)
and, on Windows, import libraries built from export lists derived from
mingw-w64's (ZPL 2.1). It carries no fbc binaries. Its licences/ directory holds
the notices for all of it.
The toolchain contains LGPL binaries, so distributing it carries the obligation
to offer their source.
